<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB cuts Aegon to &quot;hold&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB cuts Aegon to &quot;hold&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch insurance group Aegon NV was cut to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;buy&quot; at CS First Boston, a research note from analyst Kishore Banger at the brokerage said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The note said the move reflected concerns over the recent Providian acquisition in the U.S. and the stock's full valuation.</p>
<p>The stock was down 1.50 guilders at 117.60 guilders by 1404 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
